    factsAdvanced: { de: ["Zentraler Teil des Hafengebiets Port Hercule", "Berühmter Teil des Formel-1-Kurses", "Direkt nach dem Tunnel-Ausgang gelegen", "Hauptverbindungsstraße am Hafen", "Hohe sportliche Symbolik", "Zentrum für nautisches Flair", "Wichtige Verkehrsachse für La Condamine"], hu: [], ro: [], en: ["Features an iconic location in Monaco", "Integral to the local infrastructure", "Reflects the principality's architectural heritage", "Attracts international interest and prestige", "Strategically situated in a high-value district", "Showcases modern urban planning integrated with history", "Offers unique insights into Monégasque society"] }
