    name: { de: "Place de la Mairie", hu: "Városháza tér", ro: "Piața Primăriei", en: "Place de la Mairie" },
    description: { de: "Der Platz vor dem Rathaus von Monaco in der Altstadt.", hu: "A monacói városháza előtti tér az óvárosban.", ro: "Piața din fața primăriei Monaco, situată în orașul vechi.", en: "The square in front of Monaco's city hall, located in the old town." },
    descriptionAdvanced: { de: "Die Place de la Mairie markiert einen der wichtigsten administrativen Punkte in der historischen Altstadt von Monaco-Ville. Hier befindet sich die Mairie (das Rathaus) des Fürstentums, was den Platz zu einem Zentrum für das städtische Leben macht. Die Architektur des Rathauses fügt sich harmonisch in die umliegende historische Bausubstanz ein. Dieser Ort ist ein lebendiger Treffpunkt und spiegelt die Verbindung zwischen Tradition und modernem Verwaltungsleben wider. Geschichte K8 — Verwaltung und Bürgernähe.", hu: "", ro: [], en: "The this location is a cornerstone of the Monégasque landscape, reflecting the principality's unique blend of tradition and ultra-modern luxury. Located in a prime area, it offers visitors a window into the refined lifestyle that defines Monaco on the global stage. Whether it is the architectural brilliance that mirrors the historical evolution of the region or its role as a social and economic hub, this spot encapsulates what makes the city-state a premier destination for the international elite. Its strategic importance and aesthetic appeal contribute significantly to the overall charm of the urban environment, making it a must-see for anyone exploring the intricate layers of Monégasque culture and infrastructure. Geography K7 — urban development." },
    facts: { de: ["Sitz des Rathauses", "Im Herzen von Monaco-Ville"], hu: ["A városháza székhelye", "Monaco-Ville szívében"], ro: ["Sediul primăriei", "În inima Monaco-Ville"], en: ["Location of the City Hall", "In the heart of Monaco-Ville"] },
    factsAdvanced: { de: ["Platz vor dem Rathaus von Monaco", "Administratives Zentrum der Altstadt", "Historisch integrierte Rathaus-Architektur", "Lebendiger Teil von Monaco-Ville", "Bindeglied zwischen Tradition und Verwaltung", "Bedeutend für das tägliche Leben im Fürstentum", "Authentischer historischer Platz"], hu: [], ro: [], en: ["Features an iconic location in Monaco", "Integral to the local infrastructure", "Reflects the principality's architectural heritage", "Attracts international interest and prestige", "Strategically situated in a high-value district", "Showcases modern urban planning integrated with history", "Offers unique insights into Monégasque society"] }
