    name: { de: "Rue des Ordonnances", hu: "Rue des Ordonnances", ro: "Rue des Ordonnances", en: "Rue des Ordonnances" },
    description: { de: "Eine Gasse in der Nähe des Palastplatzes in Monaco-Ville.", hu: "Egy sikátor a Palota tér közelében Monaco-Ville-ben.", ro: "O alee lângă Piața Palatului din Monaco-Ville.", en: "An alley near the Palace Square in Monaco-Ville." },
    descriptionAdvanced: { de: "Die Rue des Ordonnances ist eine von vielen Gassen, die den historischen Kern von Monaco-Ville um den Palastplatz herum bilden. Ihre Nähe zum Fürstenpalast verleiht ihr eine ganz eigene, fast ehrwürdige Atmosphäre. Sie ist ein Ort, an dem die Geschichte des Fürstentums greifbar wird, besonders im Kontrast zur glanzvollen Modernität der tiefer gelegenen Viertel. Die gut erhaltene, mittelalterliche Struktur erinnert an die Zeit der Verteidigung des Felsens. Geschichte K6 — Tradition.", hu: "", ro: [], en: "The this location is a cornerstone of the Monégasque landscape, reflecting the principality's unique blend of tradition and ultra-modern luxury. Located in a prime area, it offers visitors a window into the refined lifestyle that defines Monaco on the global stage. Whether it is the architectural brilliance that mirrors the historical evolution of the region or its role as a social and economic hub, this spot encapsulates what makes the city-state a premier destination for the international elite. Its strategic importance and aesthetic appeal contribute significantly to the overall charm of the urban environment, making it a must-see for anyone exploring the intricate layers of Monégasque culture and infrastructure. Geography K7 — urban development." },
    facts: { de: ["Historische Altstadt", "Nahe dem Fürstenpalast"], hu: ["Történelmi óváros", "A Hercegi Palota közelében"], ro: ["Oraș vechi istoric", "Aproape de Palatul Princiar"], en: ["Historic Old Town", "Near the Prince's Palace"] },
    factsAdvanced: { de: ["Gasse in Monaco-Ville", "Direkte Nähe zum Fürstenpalast", "Historisch ehrwürdige Atmosphäre", "Teil der Altstadt-Struktur", "Kontrast zur Moderne", "Spürbare Geschichte des Rocher", "Authentischer historischer Ort"], hu: [], ro: [], en: ["Features an iconic location in Monaco", "Integral to the local infrastructure", "Reflects the principality's architectural heritage", "Attracts international interest and prestige", "Strategically situated in a high-value district", "Showcases modern urban planning integrated with history", "Offers unique insights into Monégasque society"] }
