    coords: [7.423, 43.731],
    name: { de: "Rue de la Poste", hu: "Posta utca", ro: "Strada Poștei", en: "Rue de la Poste" },
    description: { de: "Eine kleine Straße in Monaco-Ville in der Nähe des Postamtes der Altstadt.", hu: "Kis utca Monaco-Ville-ben, az óvárosi posta közelében.", ro: "O mică stradă în Monaco-Ville, lângă oficiul poștal din orașul vechi.", en: "A small street in Monaco-Ville near the old town's post office." },
    descriptionAdvanced: { de: "Diese Rue in Monaco-Ville bewahrt den historischen Charakter der Altstadt. Die Nähe zum örtlichen Postamt unterstreicht die alltägliche Bedeutung, die diese Gassen auch für die heutigen Anwohner haben, trotz ihrer langen Geschichte. Beim Spaziergang durch die Rue de la Poste erlebt man die Ruhe, die den Felsen nach dem Ende der täglichen Touristenströme prägt. Sie ist ein authentisches Zeugnis des Lebens in einer der historischen Gassen von Monaco. Geschichte K5 — Altstadtalltag.", hu: "", ro: [], en: "The this location is a cornerstone of the Monégasque landscape, reflecting the principality's unique blend of tradition and ultra-modern luxury. Located in a prime area, it offers visitors a window into the refined lifestyle that defines Monaco on the global stage. Whether it is the architectural brilliance that mirrors the historical evolution of the region or its role as a social and economic hub, this spot encapsulates what makes the city-state a premier destination for the international elite. Its strategic importance and aesthetic appeal contribute significantly to the overall charm of the urban environment, making it a must-see for anyone exploring the intricate layers of Monégasque culture and infrastructure. Geography K7 — urban development." },
    facts: { de: ["Postamt in der Altstadt", "Historische Straße"], hu: ["Posta az óvárosban", "Történelmi utca"], ro: ["Oficiu poștal în orașul vechi", "Stradă istorică"], en: ["Old Town post office", "Historic street"] },
